nter;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\">Create: Better Villager</span> 為遊戲增添了多種來自 Create 模組的村莊職業 <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0120b73c-046a-4b20-b605-562d6bff7358.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\"></strong></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>功能列表</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">安山石工人</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;販售 Create 模組的安山石零件</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Work Bench - BASIN</pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_da38d869-08c8-4802-9661-9556b54df776.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"408\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">黃銅工人</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;販售 Create 模組的黃銅零件</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Work Bench - ROTATION_SPEED_CONTROLLER</strong></pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9a5dab7e-714a-438e-8975-0f9c0998d18e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>銅工人</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;販售 Create 模組的銅零件&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Work Bench - STEAM_ENGINE</pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5f749160-0cf1-4092-b1bc-24e489aceb86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"416\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">礦工</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>購買並販售安山石、銅與黃銅的原始零件</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Work Bench - MECHANICAL_ARM</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_12d7c9e4-8f6e-4671-83c8-be482971af59.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"418\" height=\"418\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>模組評測影片</strong>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zLU_LUCBQJY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">感謝 dejojotheawsome</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">對本模組進行評測</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">請跳至 2:40 觀看《Create: Better Villager》評測</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>前往 GitHub 或 Modrinth 瀏覽《Create: Better Villager》</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/createletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7186e4e2-24e8-4cfd-80c1-294cafaf58c9.gif\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>",
